but it looks like your issue is upstream, and it pertains to data
transformation before you call joinCountryData2Map.

What is it exactly that you want to plot? Do you have this percentage
characters in the data frame itself? Can you give us for instance the
output of "str(wvsneu)" in R?

   JB

